criticalIdeal -- ideal of critical equations of a semidefinite program
**********************************************************************

  * Usage: 
        (I,X,y,Z) = criticalIdeal(P)
        (I,X,y,Z) = criticalIdeal(P,rk)
  * Inputs:
      * P, an instance of the type *note SDP: SDP,, a semidefinite programming
        problem
      * rk, an *note integer: (Macaulay2Doc)ZZ,, the rank of the primal matrix
        (optional)
  * Outputs:
      * I, an *note ideal: (Macaulay2Doc)Ideal,, of critical equations
      * X, an $n\times n$ matrix, primal variable
      * y, an $m\times 1$ matrix, dual variable
      * Z, an $n\times n$ matrix, dual variable

Description
===========

This method computes the ideal of critical equations of an SDP. This ideal can
be used to solve the SDP symbolically.

+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : A = (-matrix{{0,1,0},{1,0,0},{0,0,1}}, matrix{{0,0,1},{0,0,0},{1,0,0}}, |
|-----------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|-matrix{{0,0,0},{0,0,1},{0,1,0}});                                           |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : (C, b) = (matrix{{1/1,0,3},{0,5,0},{3,0,9}}, matrix{{-1},{-1},{-1}});   |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i3 : P = sdp(C,A,b);                                                         |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i4 : (I,X,y,Z) = criticalIdeal P;                                            |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i5 : degree I                                                                |
|                                                                             |
|o5 = 6                                                                       |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+

We can restrict the rank of the primal matrix X.

+--------------------------------------+
|i6 : rk = 1;                          |
+--------------------------------------+
|i7 : (J,X,y,Z) = criticalIdeal(P, rk);|
+--------------------------------------+
|i8 : degree J                         |
|                                      |
|o8 = 4                                |
+--------------------------------------+


