refine(SDP,Sequence) -- refine an SDP solution
**********************************************

  * Function: *note refine: (NumericalAlgebraicGeometry)refine_lpList_cmList_rp
    ,
  * Usage: 
        (X1,y1) = refine(P,(X0,y0))
  * Inputs:
      * P, an instance of the type *note SDP: SDP,, a semidefinite programming
        problem
      * X0y0, a *note sequence: (Macaulay2Doc)Sequence,, primal and dual
        solutions
  * *note Optional inputs: (Macaulay2Doc)using functions with optional inputs,:
      * *note Bits: (NumericalAlgebraicGeometry)numerical homotopy tracking
        options, => ..., default value null,
      * *note ErrorTolerance: (NumericalAlgebraicGeometry)numerical homotopy
        tracking options, => ..., default value null,
      * *note Iterations: (NumericalAlgebraicGeometry)numerical homotopy
        tracking options, => ..., default value null,
      * *note ResidualTolerance: (NumericalAlgebraicGeometry)numerical homotopy
        tracking options, => ..., default value null,
      * *note SingularConditionNumber: (NumericalAlgebraicGeometry)setDefault,
        => ..., default value null,
      * *note Software: (NumericalAlgebraicGeometry)Software, => ..., default
        value null,
  * Outputs:
      * X1y1, a *note list: (Macaulay2Doc)List,, refined primal and dual
        solutions

Description
===========

This function uses Newton's method to improve the precision of an optimal
primal/dual pair. The refined solution has relative error bounded by min(*note
ErrorTolerance: (NumericalAlgebraicGeometry)numerical homotopy tracking
options,,2(-*note Bits: (NumericalAlgebraicGeometry)numerical homotopy tracking
options,)). The number of iterations made is at most *note Iterations:
(NumericalAlgebraicGeometry)numerical homotopy tracking options,.

+---------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : P = sdp(matrix{{1,0},{0,2}}, matrix{{0,1},{1,0}}, matrix{{-1}});|
+---------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : (X0,y0) = (matrix{{.71, -.5}, {-.5, .35}}, matrix{{-1.41}})     |
|                                                                     |
|o2 = (| .71 -.5 |, | -1.41 |)                                        |
|      | -.5 .35 |                                                    |
|                                                                     |
|o2 : Sequence                                                        |
+---------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i3 : (X1,y1) = refine(P,(X0,y0))                                     |
|                                                                     |
|o3 = (| .707107 -.5     |, | -1.41421 |)                             |
|      | -.5     .353553 |                                            |
|                                                                     |
|o3 : Sequence                                                        |
+---------------------------------------------------------------------+


